WEBVTT

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:37.150
Cocona...

00:02:09.740 --> 00:02:11.330
Those are some long limbs.

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:13.680
Did she run away from somewhere?

00:02:15.340 --> 00:02:16.070
She's awake.

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:18.220
Hey, do you understand us?

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:19.820
Think we can sell this?

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:21.820
Cocona?

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:23.700
That's...

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:28.290
Elder!

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:29.960
Elder!

00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:34.240
Wait!

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:35.670
Sorry.

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:41.090
They're all scared because they've 
never seen anyone like you before.

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:43.700
You won't do anything scary?

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:44.550
No.

00:02:59.190 --> 00:03:00.070
That's all.

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:02.140
I want more!

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:11.790
Our underground water is split 
among everyone in small shares.

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:15.740
The ones responsible for 
growing crops, cooking,

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:20.180
or doing laundry get more as needed, though.

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:32.940
Thanks for saving me.

00:03:56.850 --> 00:04:00.350
It's a little poisonous, 
so don't suck in too much.

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:04.050
Where are you from, Papika?

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:07.350
Somewhere that's not here.

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:10.780
I'm looking for Cocona and the rest.

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:12.000
Cocona?

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.270
I got separated from them.

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:17.210
I've been looking for her for ages, 
but I can't smell her at all.

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:20.190
I saw a shooting star a few days ago.

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:24.970
While I was making a wish, it split into two.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:27.860
If that was you guys, then...

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:29.560
Which way did Cocona go?

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:31.540
Er...

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:36.540
I only have potatoes, but if you'd like...

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:37.670
Potatoes?!

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:44.170
Tch. What a dump this village is.

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:47.770
Bring out all the food and water ya got!

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:51.100
Hurry up, damn it!

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:56.060
I feel alive again!

00:04:56.300 --> 00:04:57.900
O-Our water!

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:00.400
Please, have mercy.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.230
We barely have enough to live...

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:03.240
Shut it, geezer!

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:04.810
Die!

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:10.300
Now ya got one less mouth to feed.

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:19.600
Ya bitch!

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:21.250
Who the hell are ya?!

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:22.950
Papika.

00:05:23.310 --> 00:05:24.920
G-Girl...

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:29.690
Papika? From which gang?!

00:05:29.690 --> 00:05:32.120
What a ridiculous name!

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:38.980
I think it's cute. Sounds kinda like 
"puppy," huh, Puppy-chan?

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:45.030
Shake!

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:58.120
Once more... Shake!

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:58.780
Sit.

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:10.840
Crap! She's insane!

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:12.690
Quit pissin' yer pants!

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:28.900
Lady Cocona!

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:31.450
It's up to you, Lady Cocona!

00:06:31.730 --> 00:06:33.090
Cocona?

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:35.200
No! That mask...

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:50.270
Cocona...

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:52.140
No, you're not.

00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:54.060
You...

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:58.680
I hate you!

00:07:05.930 --> 00:07:07.850
Boss Lady!

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:09.740
Papika!

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:11.720
We must go after her.

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:18.160
Who are you?

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:20.120
Why'd you attack the village?

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:22.640
Those are Cocona's clothes!

00:07:22.640 --> 00:07:24.420
Where is Cocona?!

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:35.300
That's the Illusory Divine Fist!

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:37.010
You know it, Elder?

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:38.520
Watch closely.

00:07:38.940 --> 00:07:41.780
We are about to witness what you could call

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:44.020
Boss lady!

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:44.020
the secret foundation of our very world—

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:46.910
the dance of miracles.

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:54.070
Give back Cocona!

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:04.920
This scent...

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:10.830
Don't lose, Papika!

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:12.450
Fight, Papi!

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:14.380
Fight!

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:16.890
Is it you, Cocona?

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:19.680
Found you.

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:51.590
Papika!

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:53.960
H-Hey, she's pretty cute...

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:54.960
Let me see!

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:55.930
Whoa!

00:09:00.070 --> 00:09:02.140
Papika! Papika!

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:03.290
What have I...

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:06.110
Cocona?

00:09:06.680 --> 00:09:08.200
Found you...

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:12.410
Papika!

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:15.990
What, done already?

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:19.740
What a letdown.

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:25.210
I knew it.

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:26.320
Who's that?!

00:09:25.610 --> 00:09:26.960
Another cutie!

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.460
Me

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:31.800
You're...

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:35.970
I'm glad you remember me.

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:44.410
Is this...

00:09:45.090 --> 00:09:46.600
Pure Illusion?

00:09:47.030 --> 00:09:48.910
Bu-chan, where's Papika?

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:53.360
Papika! Papika!

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:55.860
Where did she run off to by herself?

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:58.950
Once I find her, I'm going to let her have it.

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:14.670
Me

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:15.210
Women Women Women

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:15.590
Me

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:15.760
Women Women Women

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:15.800
Me

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:15.960
Women Women Women

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:16.050
Me

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:16.090
Women Women Women

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:16.510
Women Women Women

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:17.090
Me ♥

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:17.170
Women Women Women

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:26.820
Bu-chan!

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:30.750
Sorry, it seems my foot slipped.

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:31.520
I don't—

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:34.230
think so.

00:10:35.090 --> 00:10:37.310
Are you looking for a friend?

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:40.200
I'll help you meet her.

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:44.370
Why would you do this?

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:46.440
I was bored.

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:49.410
I wanted you two to play with me.

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:53.040
Just for that, you controlled 
me and hurt Papika?

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:56.270
You're the one who hurt her, Cocona.

00:10:56.270 --> 00:10:59.220
I'll bet the sensation is still 
fresh on your fists, yes?

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:00.300
How did it feel?

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:03.300
Did punching Papika make you feel better?

00:11:04.150 --> 00:11:04.810
Huh?

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:07.350
All that mask does

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:10.720
is amplify the feelings you already have.

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:15.550
Cocona, deep down, you must 
have wanted to punch Papika.

00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:21.820
All I did was give you a push.

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:26.740
Ya bitch!

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:28.870
Let the boss lady go!

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:30.620
Filthy worms.

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:38.120
Run for it!

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:42.020
Shh!

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:50.230
How cute.

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:52.240
How pitiful.

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:57.040
The mask's power only got a hold 
of you because you're empty.

00:11:58.030 --> 00:11:59.940
Oh, Papika-san!

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:01.130
Papi...

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:11.960
You're so lacking in identity that you 
couldn't stay in control of yourself.

00:12:12.430 --> 00:12:14.000
You have nothing.

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:18.190
It felt good playing the villain, didn't it?

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:21.800
You truly shone in the 
role you got at long last.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:24.010
You want to achieve something, don't you?

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:25.970
You want to be someone, don't you?

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:30.960
If you come with me, I'll give you a role.

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:33.080
No.

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:35.750
Oh?

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:37.350
Too bad.

00:12:38.850 --> 00:12:41.810
I'll just take your fragment, then.

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:44.450
Cocona!

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:48.700
Heroic

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:54.070
Cocona.

00:12:54.070 --> 00:12:56.360
Papika? How?

00:12:56.360 --> 00:12:57.360
I ate a potato.

00:12:57.360 --> 00:12:58.140
Potato?

00:12:58.140 --> 00:13:00.540
It was warm and sweet, 
and it made me all shiny!

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:01.440
Shiny?

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:07.860
Say "ahh."

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:09.400
Ahh.

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:13.090
Swallow it.

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:20.620
Good to go, Cocona?

00:13:21.660 --> 00:13:22.540
Yeah.

00:13:27.690 --> 00:13:28.830
Transform!

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:57.270
<i>Transformation</i>

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:25.170
<i>Transformation</i>

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:29.030
My passionate feelings will repel everything!

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:31.800
Pure Barrier!

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:34.900
Cut, cut, and cut it all away!

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:37.560
Pure Blade!

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:39.900
Evil flower of Pure Illusion...

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:41.810
We're going to pluck you out!

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:46.160
That's the Gung-Ho Potato for you.

00:14:46.160 --> 00:14:47.320
They're so gung-ho.

00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:50.160
This is pumping me up!

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:58.370
It'll take more than that!

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:01.670
It's two against one, after all!

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:15.890
Papika Hundred Raging Waves

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:15.890
Papika Hundred Raging Waves!

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:30.150
Cocona Flash Rending Slash

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:30.150
Cocona Flash Rending Slash!

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:31.960
It hurts...

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:33.280
But it's so fun!

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:37.040
I think it's about time I got serious.

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:43.860
What is that?

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:44.490
It's huge!

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:45.780
I'm scared!

00:15:45.780 --> 00:15:47.840
It showed its true form.

00:15:57.660 --> 00:15:58.760
She's gone.

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:00.170
Yeah.

00:16:00.170 --> 00:16:02.500
Behind you! Behind you!

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:22.120
My!

00:16:28.530 --> 00:16:29.980
Ow...

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:33.970
Now's our chance!

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:34.750
Yeah.

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:45.990
Papika!

00:16:47.370 --> 00:16:48.250
Yeah!

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:51.510
Here we go!

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:52.320
Yeah!

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:20.690
Full power!

00:17:39.170 --> 00:17:41.260
We did it.

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:45.900
All right!

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:46.620
Happy

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:49.450
What in the world was that?

00:17:51.660 --> 00:17:55.600
Sorry for hitting you, Papika.

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:59.470
It's okay. I punched and kicked you, too.

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:00.910
And I said I hated you...

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:02.790
But I love you.

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:03.570
Uh-huh.

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:06.300
It's true! I love, love, <i>love</i> you!

00:18:06.300 --> 00:18:07.280
Gee, thanks.

00:18:07.280 --> 00:18:09.980
Listen to me! I love, love, 
love, love, love, love—

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:11.150
Shut up.

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:42.670
Wow...

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:45.590
U-Uh, thank you—

00:18:45.590 --> 00:18:46.550
You're too naïve.

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:53.150
You can't traverse Pure Illusion like that.

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.430
Yayaka?!

00:18:55.430 --> 00:18:56.650
Why?

00:19:04.100 --> 00:19:05.760
Hey, don't take that!

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:08.830
It's only fair, isn't it? 
We're the ones who finished it off.

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:10.540
No!

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:19.240
How did you transform?

00:19:19.240 --> 00:19:20.280
Tell us.

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:22.140
Cocona!

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:25.220
Let's go. We got the amorphous.

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:27.390
Roger.

00:19:27.720 --> 00:19:31.250
I saw that your hole was really high up.

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:33.070
Good luck getting back.

00:19:33.070 --> 00:19:33.780
Bye-bye.

00:19:33.780 --> 00:19:34.650
Bye-bye.

00:19:39.180 --> 00:19:40.650
Hold it, Yayaka!

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:56.520
Papika!

00:20:03.190 --> 00:20:04.880
What was that?

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:11.740
The girl just now?

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:13.020
Yes.

00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:16.800
So that's Papikana...

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:20.280
One half of the Direct Drive.

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:34.670
Asclepius. Asclepius.

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:31.160
Only a few amorphous remain.

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:34.420
All for our glorious world.

00:20:37.140 --> 00:20:38.500
Ow!

00:20:38.930 --> 00:20:40.240
Ouch...

00:20:41.870 --> 00:20:42.960
Salt!

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:46.110
Yayaka was... This weird bunch was...

00:20:46.110 --> 00:20:48.510
<i>Stabilize the impedance.</i>

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:50.260
<i>We'll talk after that.</i>

00:20:51.820 --> 00:20:53.550
Hey, Salt!

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:56.560
They're coming directly at us now.

00:20:56.880 --> 00:21:01.800
I bet they're trying to show that 
they can take 'em anytime they want.

00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:03.820
Even if we collect fragments...

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:06.070
We'd just be sitting ducks.

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:08.370
Dr. Salt.

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:10.930
There is a way.

00:22:43.220 --> 00:22:45.510
Wasn't Yayaka your friend?

00:22:46.150 --> 00:22:47.440
We go way back.

00:22:47.440 --> 00:22:48.840
You got payback?

00:22:49.150 --> 00:22:50.760
I've known her for years...

00:22:50.760 --> 00:22:51.970
How should I put it?

00:22:53.970 --> 00:22:55.210
What time is it now?!

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:03.690
I'm home.

00:23:04.120 --> 00:23:06.560
The cram school called.

00:23:06.560 --> 00:23:07.850
What happened?

00:23:12.560 --> 00:23:13.860
Cocona.

00:23:17.420 --> 00:23:18.770
I'm glad you're okay.

00:23:18.770 --> 00:23:23.160
From now on, call and let me know 
when you're going to be late, okay?

00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:25.420
Okay.

00:23:26.660 --> 00:23:27.940
I'm sorry.

00:23:29.960 --> 00:23:32.080
Next time on <i>Flip Flappers</i>:

00:23:32.080 --> 00:23:33.280
"Pure Kwal...

00:23:33.590 --> 00:23:35.160
P-Pure Igwall...

00:23:35.480 --> 00:23:36.420
Pure Coll...

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:38.930
Pure Equalization

00:23:37.480 --> 00:23:38.930
Pure something!
